---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const lastUpdated = '2026-08-24';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="Terms for using the CoreFlow website and requesting a consultation."
>
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="kicker">Legal</span>
      <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="notice">
        <strong>Review before publishing:</strong> this covers use of the marketing website and the
        consultation-request process only. It intentionally does not cover the CoreFlow product
        itself (a separate product ToS/SLA is a decision for when customer contracts begin) — the
        owner should confirm that scope is correct before this goes live, and add a real company
        name/legal entity once one is registered.
      </div>

      <h2>Scope</h2>
      <p>
        These terms cover your use of this website (coreflow.example) and the free-consultation
        request process. They don't cover the CoreFlow product itself, which is governed by a
        separate agreement once you become a customer.
      </p>

      <h2>Using this site</h2>
      <p>
        You may browse this site and submit the consultation-request form for genuine business
        inquiries. Don't use the form to submit spam, attempt to compromise the site, or misrepresent
        who you are.
      </p>

      <h2>No commitment from a consultation request</h2>
      <p>
        Requesting a free consultation doesn't create a contract, a purchase obligation, or a
        commitment on either side. It's a conversation.
      </p>

      <h2>Content</h2>
      <p>
        Everything on this site — text, the CoreFlow name and logo, images — belongs to CoreFlow
        and may not be reused without permission. Case studies, when published, are shared only
        with the named customer's explicit permission.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms as the site and business evolve. The date at the top reflects the last update.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms: see the contact details on our <a href="/about">About page</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .wrap {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 64px 24px 80px;
  }
  .kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-core);
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 32px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  .updated {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .notice {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-flow);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin: 28px 0;
  }
  h2 {
    font-size: 19px;
    margin-top: 36px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
</style>
